  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"8f996405-d870-4074-947b-35190faad643\">\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"/images/articles/8f996405-d870-4074-947b-35190faad643-1.jpg\" alt=\"A snowy path beside bare winter trees\">\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"poem\">\n  <p>City of God, how broad and far<br>\n  outspread thy walls sublime!<br>\n  The true thy chartered freemen are<br>\n  of every age and clime:</p>\n\n  <p>One holy church, one army strong,<br>\n  one steadfast, high intent;<br>\n  one working band, one harvest-song,<br>\n  one King omnipotent.</p>\n\n  <p>How purely hath thy speech come down<br>\n  from man's primaeval youth!<br>\n  How grandly hath thine empire grown<br>\n  of freedom, love, and truth!</p>\n\n  <p>How gleam thy watch-fires through the night<br>\n  with never-fainting ray!<br>\n  How rise thy towers, serene and bright,<br>\n  to meet the dawning day!</p>\n\n  <p>In vain the surge's angry shock,<br>\n  in vain the drifting sands:<br>\n  unharmed upon the eternal Rock<br>\n  the eternal city stands.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n",
